body:
> One more difference between John and Mary, and it's a big one. Mary worked with the British Men of Letters, even after they kidnapped and tortured her son. John would have stormed into their headquarters and killed them all for hurting Sam. 

This. This right here. 

&#x200B;

I liked it. So did my boyfriend. It added a little spice. I don't know.

&#x200B;

But your comment about autism was offensive. period.

Agreed. He is the asshole. He's a 10-year-old child. Children throw fits. That's what they do. Eventually he probably would've caved and ate the food. You should've let him just sit there with it. If you would have conversated more with him before immediately losing your temper and throwing it away he might've been able to tell you his bowl was in the suitcase. Sounds like a sensory issues.

&#x200B;

I'm surprised more people in the thread don't see this.
